mage" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#970118"><strong>双站游玩</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>同时成为基金会与被放逐者之图书馆的作者</strong></span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <div class="no-footer"> <div class="no-addendum"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">作品页自检</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">以评分排序</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="no-footer"> <div class="no-addendum"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">快捷链接</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">我的代码水平：复制粘贴</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/guide-hub">指导中心</a> · <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-style-resource">SCP格式资源</a> · <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wiki-syntax">Wiki语法</a> · <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/%E6%A0%B7%E7%89%88#pages">样板页</a> · <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/system:page-tags/tag/%E7%89%88%E5%BC%8F#pages">版式页</a> · <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/advanced-formatting-and-you">你与高级格式</a> · <a href="http://topia.wikidot.com/bhl-preparation-tool">BHL Prep Tool</a></strong></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="no-footer"> <div class="no-addendum"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">2021“殴